  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe aebele Mose ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Salamo intungulushi imo imo ukufuma muli cila cikolwe ca luko, kabili ushitume nge nengu shiye lengula icalo ca Kenani, ico ndi nokupeela ku bena Israeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose acita ngefyo Yawe amukonkomeshe, atuma intungulushi ukufuma ku matololo ya ku Parani. Bonsefye bali ni ntungulushi sha bena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amashina yashiko ni aya. Shamua mwana Sakuri, uwa mu luko lwakwa Rubeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shafati mwana Hori, uwa mu luko lwakwa Simeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalebu mwana Yefune, uwa mu luko lwakwa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igali mwana Yosefu, uwa mu luko lwakwa Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoshea mwana Nuni, uwa mu luko lwakwa Efulemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paliti mwana Rafu, uwa mu luko lwakwa Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadieli mwana Sodi, uwa mu luko lwakwa Sebuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadi mwana Susi, uwa mu luko lwakwa Yosefu, e luko lwakwa Manase wine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amieli mwana Gemali, uwa mu luko lwakwa Dani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seturi mwana Mikaeli, uwa mu luko lwakwa Asheri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabi mwana Fofisi, uwa mu luko lwakwa Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geueli mwana Maki, uwa mu luko lwakwa Gadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya e mashina ya bantu Mose atumine kukulengula icalo ca Kenani. Mose elyo ainika Hoshea mwana Nuni, ishina lya Yoshua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakubatuma kukulengula icalo ca Kenani, Mose abebele ati, “Muye mwingilile ku matololo ya Negebu, elyo muye na mu calo ca mpili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muye mona ifyo icalo caba, na bantu bekalamo nga balikosa nangu tabakosa, nga balifula nangu tabafula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe calo ca musango nshi baikalamo? Cisuma nangu cibi? Misumba ya musango shani baikalamo? Bushe, misumba ya malinga nangu iyoo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo mushili waba shani? Untu wafunda nangu iyoo? Nge miti, emo yaba nangu iyoo? Muyeshipafye, na pakubwela mukaleteko ne fisabo fimo ifikula muli cilya calo.” Cali pa nshita ifisabo fyantanshi ifya myangashi fitendekelapo ukufiluka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba bantu baile no kulengula icalo ukutendekalafye ku matololo ya Sini no kuya shintafye na ku Rehobu, mupepi na ku Lebo Hamati",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lebo Hamati:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ishiwi lya Lebo lilanda apakwingilila ku musumba wa Hamati.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baingilile ku matololo ya Negebu elyo baisa na ku musumba wa Hebuloni, uko Ahimani, Sheshai na Talimai aba mu lupwa lwakwa Anaki baleikala. Umusumba wa Hebuloni wakuulilwe imyaka cine lubali ninshi umusumba wa Soani uwa mu calo ca Egupto taulakulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo bafikile mwishika lya Eshikoli",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:23",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Eshikoli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ili shina lyalola ukutila, “Icisansangu.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", eko bateta umusambo wa cisansangu ca myangashi icafina nganshi. Abantu babili ebacipinga pakucisenda ku mutembo. Basendako na mateke na makunyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico cine calenga nokuti iyi ncende bainike ne shina lye shika lya Eshikoli, pantu eko abena Israeli batetele icisansangu cilya ica myangashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo papwile inshiku amakumi yane (40), inengu shabweluluka kukulengula icalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo baisa kuli Mose na Aroni, na ku lukuta lonse ulwa bena Israeli ku Kadeshi mu matololo ya Parani nokubashimikila ifyo bamwene. Babalanga ne fisabo baleteleko ukufuma kuli cilya calo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashimikila Mose abati, “Twaile lengula icalo ico watutumineko, kabili cine cine mufumfumuka umukaka no buci, nefi e fisabo fyaciko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo abantu bekalamo, bena bamaka nganshi ne misumba yabo nayo ikalamba icine cine kabili ya malinga ayakosa. Kabili twamweneko na ba mu lupwa lwakwa Anaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Amaleki ebekala mu Negebu, elyo abena Hiti, abena Yebusi na bena Amoli bekala mu calo ca mpili. Kabili abena Kenani bena bekalila mu lulamba lwa bemba na ku lulamba lwa mumana wa Yordani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalebu atalalike abantu pa cinso cakwa Mose, “Tufwile ukuya poka cilya calo no kwikalamo pantu natukwata amaka yakuya cimfya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
