        {
          "text": "Kabili twalimweneko na Banefilimu (Abana bakwa Anaki e bamo aba mu mutundu wa Banefilimu). Ifwe twalemonekafye kwati fipaso mu menso yesu, nabo bene efyo baletumona.”",
